ticular tested zendaya's  nerves she'd come to set ready to do a  big trapeze stunt and when she arrived  she got a bit of a shock the rig she was  going to be on was about  20 feet higher than she thought it was  going to be to make things even worse  there wasn't even a net underneath  that's a little  that's a lot to get over that's right  the actress was going to perform a  tricky trapeze stunt for real  and it wasn't going to be as easy as  diving into all of her training  beforehand  while zendaya knew she'd be rigged up  and extremely safe  she hadn't been so prepared for it to  feel so intense  however just in the nick of time hugh  jackman came to the rescue  zendaya shared that behind the scenes  jackman came over to her while she was  on set  ready to go up in the cherry picker and  told her that she was a badass  turns out that was all the help she  needed and i was like  take me up after being called that by  the hugh jackman  zendaya felt like she could do  absolutely anything so  she eagerly went up in the cherry picker  to take her place at the top of the  circus tent  ready to dazzle and impress she wound up  loving it in the end  and was really grateful that she got to  do it for the role since it's not really  a discipline she would have picked up  otherwise  i never thought that i would be doing  any type of acrobatic  trapeze work in my life it wasn't all  magical aerial tricks and confidence  boosters from hugh jackman though  zendaya and zac efron had more than a  few mishaps together behind the scenes  we know it's hard to believe considering  how elegant and romantic they look  together on screen  but sometimes they really missed the  mark  zendaya and defront were practicing one  of the aerial tricks they performed  together  you know the one the iconic swinging  around the ring scene  as we can see in the movie they  gracefully grab onto each other but when  rehearsing  instead of the elegant trick they miss  their marks and the two of the